APPLETON, Minn. — New records obtained by KARE 11 show the company that owned a vacant private prison in Appleton, Minnesota offered to sell it to the state in 2025 for $75 million.

One year later, the Trump administration agreed to use taxpayer funds to buy the same abandoned prison from CoreCivic, Inc., for $495.6 million.  

The price difference, $420 million, is more than taxpayers are estimated to have lost in Minnesota’s much-publicized Feeding Our Future fraud scandal. 
A Shuttered Prison 

In the tiny western Minnesota town of Appleton, population less than 1,400, sits the site of what’s been described as the most expensive property purchase in Minnesota history: a 34-year-old vacant prison, shuttered for 16 years.

In August, the federal Department of Homeland Security purchased the Prairie Correctional Facility from CoreCivic, Inc, to use it as an ICE detention center.</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/9hYB2Bv</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Apeofdeath]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Oh Fuck Off!</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/0lJgOe3</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/eQ7Pzw9.png" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/taa6hTk.png" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>https://www.tomshardware.com/tech-industry/data-centers/openai-ceo-says-its-quite-terrible-for-your-pc-to-have-ram-sam-altman-says-data-centers-offer-better-utilization</div></div>]]></description><guid>https://imgur.com/a/0lJgOe3</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Imadethisaccounttopost]]></dc:creator></item><item><title>Happy Halloween from Tokyo!</title><link>https://imgur.com/gallery/YJ1bT2o</link><description><![CDATA[<div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/sXg71fS.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>I hate going out to places alone, so I’ll probably just be staying home tonight sadly. And it feels like any big, public Halloween events are basically banned here at this point.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/YrAY3kq.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>And nothing feels worse than buying an expensive ticket to a Halloween Party at a bar or club and then drinking alone in a room full of people.</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/gTzH0ge.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>Hope everyone else gets to enjoy their Halloween wherever you are though!</div><div><img alt="" src="https://i.imgur.com/OOkKtkK.jpg" style="max-width: 90%; height: auto;"></div><div><span></span></div><div>#halloween #halloween_cos